Build the project incrementally. Do not generate the entire application in one response. Start by creating the complete folder structure, package.json, and application architecture. Then implement one module at a time (authentication, database, products, categories, media library, static site generator, Git integration, etc.). Each module must be complete, tested, and integrated before moving to the next. Provide clear setup instructions and commands whenever new dependencies are introduced.

